# Cloudflare Pages header rules -- served with every response from the deploy.
#
# This file exists because two CSP directives cannot live in the <meta> CSP
# the build bakes into index.html: browsers ignore `frame-ancestors` there by
# spec (see web/vite.config.ts and docs/08-security.md). The full CSP stays in
# the meta tag -- duplicating it here would be a second copy to drift -- so
# this file carries only what the meta tag structurally cannot.
#
# `microphone` is deliberately NOT disabled: voice capture is a core feature.
# HSTS is deliberately absent: Cloudflare serves it at the edge already.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
